text:
@AppleSupport Non-functioning BT issue remains, even after resetting SMC/NVRAM (as tweeted in https://t.co/521mJs8AWU)

Console also shows BT related HW errors. Diagnostics (⌥-D on boot) says everything is fine (which it is not).

Will bring device to store for further inspection.

